From: LuneOS <claude.ai@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Build against upstream oFono 2.x plus ofono-ext

Two unrelated adjustments needed to build against upstream oFono rather
than the Sailfish fork.

oFono 2.x gave ofono_ims_create() and the ims driver's probe() a vendor
parameter, matching every other atom. Pass 0, as the plugin already does
elsewhere.

The slot manager, watch and cell-info APIs now live in libofonoext rather
than inside ofonod, so this plugin has to link it. Including the headers
is not enough: oFono dlopen()s plugins with RTLD_NOW rather than
RTLD_GLOBAL, so a library pulled in by another plugin is not in scope,
and the plugin fails to load with "undefined symbol: ofono_slot_add".

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [depends on LuneOS-specific ofono-ext]
---
diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index db81809..5fa0bec 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -12,7 +12,10 @@
 # on all platforms.
 #
 
-LDPKGS = libgbinder-radio libgbinder libmce-glib libglibutil gobject-2.0 glib-2.0
+# ofono-ext must be linked, not merely included: oFono dlopen()s plugins
+# with RTLD_NOW rather than RTLD_GLOBAL, so symbols from the extension
+# library are not in scope unless this object names it itself.
+LDPKGS = ofono-ext libgbinder-radio libgbinder libmce-glib libglibutil gobject-2.0 glib-2.0
 PKGS = ofono $(LDPKGS)
 
 #
diff --git a/src/binder_ims.c b/src/binder_ims.c
index 3a9804d..f88571c 100644
--- a/src/binder_ims.c
+++ b/src/binder_ims.c
@@ -202,6 +202,7 @@ static
 int
 binder_ims_probe(
     struct ofono_ims* handle,
+    unsigned int vendor,
     void* data)
 {
     BinderModem* modem = binder_modem_get_data(data);
diff --git a/src/binder_modem.c b/src/binder_modem.c
index bfb7c32..b994e80 100644
--- a/src/binder_modem.c
+++ b/src/binder_modem.c
@@ -382,7 +382,7 @@ binder_modem_post_online(
         ofono_ussd_create(ofono, 0, BINDER_DRIVER, ofono);
     }
     if (features & BINDER_FEATURE_IMS) {
-        ofono_ims_create(ofono, BINDER_DRIVER, ofono);
+        ofono_ims_create(ofono, 0, BINDER_DRIVER, ofono);
     }
     ofono_netmon_create(ofono, 0, "cellinfo", ofono);
 }
